        "giulia"
      ],
      "locationIds": [
        "centro"
      ],
      "rememberedFacts": [
        "Giulia considers the hotel offer the pinnacle of barista success in Rome",
        "Luca appreciates the generous offer and asks for time to reflect, realizing security also means standardized anonymity"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
